<section v-else-if="route.path==='/technology'" class="technology-page"><div class="technology-hero"><div class="container technology-hero-inner"><div class="technology-copy"><div class="eyebrow">TECHNOLOGY CAPABILITIES</div><h1>核心技术能力</h1><p>从环境理解到自主行动，以模块化的技术体系支撑具身智能应用开发。依托 EI-Stack，贯通感知、控制、数据、训练与部署环节。</p><div class="technology-stats"><div><strong>23</strong><span>全身自由度</span></div><div><strong>50 <small>kg</small></strong><span>整机重量</span></div><div><strong>4 <small>h</small></strong><span>手册标称续航</span></div></div></div><div class="technology-visual"><div class="technology-robot-frame"><img class="technology-robot" src="/images/dasheng-brochure-4.png" alt="完整的大圣轮式人形机器人"/></div><div v-for="(t,i) in techCapabilities" :key="t.title" class="capability-float" :class="'capability-float-'+(i+1)"><component :is="t.icon" :size="20"/><span>{{t.title}}</span></div></div></div></div><div class="container technology-capabilities"><article v-for="(t,i) in techCapabilities" :key="t.title" class="technology-card"><div class="technology-card-copy"><span class="technology-number">0{{i+1}}</span><h2>{{t.title}}</h2><p>{{t.desc}}</p><ul><li v-for="tag in t.tags" :key="tag">{{tag}}</li></ul><router-link class="technology-more" to="/contact">了解更多 →</router-link></div><img class="technology-card-image" :src="t.image" :alt="t.title+'技术示意图'"/></article></div></section>
<section v-else-if="route.path==='/solutions'" class="section container"><div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">APPLICATION SCENARIOS</div><h2>多元场景应用探索</h2></div><p class="section-intro">以下为潜在应用方向示意，不代表已经交付的客户案例。</p></div><div class="solution-grid"><div v-for="s in solutions" :key="s.title" class="solution-card"><img :src="s.image" :alt="s.title"/><div class="solution-body"><span class="pill">{{s.tag}}</span><h3>{{s.title}}</h3><p>{{s.desc}}</p><router-link to="/contact">探讨合作 <ArrowUpRight :size="17"/></router-link></div></div></div><div class="process"><h2>从需求到验证的合作流程</h2><div class="process-grid"><div v-for="(p,i) in ['需求沟通','方案设计','技术开发','测试验证']" :key="p"><span>0{{i+1}}</span><h3>{{p}}</h3><p>{{['了解目标与场景','确认技术路径','开展集成与开发','评估并持续优化'][i]}}</p></div></div></div></section>
<section v-else-if="route.path==='/services'" class="section container"><div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">R&D AND SERVICES</div><h2>专业技术开发与合作服务</h2></div></div><div class="service-cards"><div v-for="(s,i) in services" :key="s.title" class="service-card"><span>0{{i+1}}</span><component :is="s.icon" :size="34"/><h3>{{s.title}}</h3><p>{{s.desc}}</p><router-link to="/contact">咨询服务 <ArrowUpRight :size="17"/></router-link></div></div><div class="wide-photo" :style="{'background-image':`linear-gradient(90deg,#071b39 5%,transparent),url(${imgs.lab})`}"><h2>面向真实需求<br/>共建智能应用</h2><router-link to="/contact" class="btn white">联系技术团队 <ArrowUpRight :size="18"/></router-link></div></section>
<section v-else-if="route.path==='/competitions'" class="section container"><div class="section-top"><div><div class="eyebrow">ACADEMIC & COMPETITIONS</div><h2>学术交流与机器人赛事</h2></div><p class="section-intro">聚焦技术交流、产学研合作与机器人创新活动。当前活动内容均为演示占位。</p></div><div class="events-feature"><img :src="imgs.event" alt="学术活动示意"/><div><span class="pill">ACADEMIC EXCHANGE</span><h2>以交流推动创新<br/>以实践探索未来</h2><p>搭建开放交流窗口，展示学术合作、技术研讨、机器人赛事与创新实践相关内容。</p><router-link class="btn primary" to="/contact">合作交流 <ArrowUpRight :size="18"/></router-link></div></div><div class="section-top spaced"><div><div class="eyebrow">EVENTS</div><h2>活动与赛事动态</h2></div></div><div class="three-grid"><article v-for="e in events" :key="e.title" class="event-card"><img :src="e.image" :alt="e.title"/><div><span class="pill">{{e.type}}</span><small>{{e.date}}</small><h3>{{e.title}}</h3><p>{{e.desc}}</p><router-link to="/contact">了解合作 <ArrowUpRight :size="17"/></router-link></div></article></div></section>
<section v-else-if="route.path==='/about'" class="section container"><div class="about-layout"><div><div class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE COMPANY</div><h2>以具身智能为方向<br/><span>连接技术、产品与场景</span></h2><p>北京具身智能科技有限公司聚焦具身智能相关技术研发、技术开发服务与机器人产品业务，探索机器人技术与实际应用需求的结合。</p><p>我们关注技术创新、产品工程化与合作生态建设，致力于以开放务实的方式推进具身智能技术发展。</p><router-link to="/contact" class="btn primary">与我们联系 <ArrowUpRight :size="17"/></router-link></div><img :src="imgs.office" alt="办公环境示意图"/></div><div class="about-values"><div><strong>技术为本</strong><p>持续关注前沿研究与工程实现</p></div><div><strong>产品驱动</strong><p>以机器人产品连接研发与应用</p></div><div><strong>开放合作</strong><p>与高校、科研机构及行业伙伴共创</p></div></div><div class="section-top spaced"><div><div class="eyebrow">OUR FOCUS</div><h2>三大业务方向</h2></div></div><div class="three-grid"><div v-for="(a,i) in [{t:'技术研发',d:'具身智能相关技术研究与验证'},{t:'技术开发服务',d:'软件开发、系统集成及技术合作'},{t:'机器人产品',d:'机器人产品展示、咨询与销售'}]" :key="a.t" class="info-card"><span class="card-num">0{{i+1}}</span><h3>{{a.t}}</h3><p>{{a.d}}</p></div></div><div class="section-top spaced"><div><div class="eyebrow">DEVELOPMENT / 发展历程</div><h2>创新旅程</h2></div></div><div class="milestone-grid"><div v-for="m in milestones" :key="m.year"><span>{{m.year}}</span><h3>{{m.title}}</h3><p>{{m.desc}}</p></div></div><div class="demo-disclaimer">发展历程为页面占位文案，不代表公司真实成立时间或历史事件。</div></section>
